The retention of the snapshots of this resource, overriding the `keep` of
the store.

A space separated list of `<n><unit>` words, the unit being `d` (day), `w`
(week), `m` (month) or `y` (year). For example `7d 4w 6m` keeps the most
recent snapshot of each day of the last seven days, of each week of the
last four weeks and of each month of the last six months. The others are
removed after each successful pass.

Without `keep` here or on the store, the snapshots are never pruned.
